  "There are three common methods of hedging:\nA. Forward Market Hedge, Money Market Hedge, Options Market\nB. Forward Market Hedge, Labor Market Hedge, Options Market\nC. Forward Market Hedge, Money Market Hedge, Competitive Market\nD. Upward Market Hedge, Money Market Hedge, Options Market\nA",
