  "Which of the following is correct?\nA. Utilization is the process of the seller opening a bank account.\nB. Utilization is the process of the seller shipping the goods, presenting documentation and getting paid.\nC. Utilization is the process of the seller shipping the goods.\nD. Utilization is the process of the seller shipping the goods, presenting documentation and opening a bank account.\nB",
