  "An __________ documentary credit conveys a commitment by the issuing bank to honor drafts or documents as presented by the beneficiary or any third parties who might negotiate or purchase the beneficiary’s drafts or documents as presented under the documentary credit.\nA. irrevocable negotiation\nB. irrevocable straight\nC. revocable\nD. revocable straight\nA",
