  "Trade and bankers’ acceptances for __________ often represent the easiest, least expensive way for a seller to provide credit to a buyer, while enjoying the security provided by the documentary transaction.\nA. collection order\nB. insurance certificate\nC. bill of lading\nD. bill of exchange\nD",
